From 0319471312bbd4c3c62a2cb36ac2b3f9b776cccf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arockiasathish S <arocs@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 16:07:42 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] - Service Prioritization: Add robust null-pointer checks to
 prevent segfaults if the utility fails to initialize.

- Slave Thread: Add missing null check for
  `m_service_prioritization_task_configurator` during `agent_reset` before
  attempting to clear QoS configurations.

- System Paths: Update `CONF_FILES_WRITABLE_PATH` from `/nvram/` to
  `/config/`.

- OS Utils: Improve file descriptor handling in `redirect_console_std`
  for system logging.

Signed-off-by: Arockiasathish S <arocs@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 CMakeLists.txt                                |   6 +-
 agent/src/beerocks/slave/son_slave_thread.cpp |   4 +-
 .../tasks/service_prioritization_task.cpp     |  12 +
 .../bcl/include/bcl/beerocks_defines.h        |   2 +-
 .../beerocks/bcl/source/beerocks_os_utils.cpp |  43 ++
 framework/common/include/mapf/common/logger.h |   2 +-
 framework/platform/bpl/cfg/rdk/bpl_cfg.cpp    | 620 +++++++++++++++++-
 framework/platform/bpl/include/bpl/bpl_cfg.h  |  11 +
 tools/qmesh_cli/qmesh_cli.c                   |   4 +-
 9 files changed, 687 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

